  <prompt>Add E2 eval/unit cases so FR-04 (no dead-end follow-on) and FR-06 (card gating) are covered and FAIL on regression. Cases: (1) an unbacked free-string suggestion does NOT render; (2) "prioritize my tasks" either works (maps to the FR-01 advisory capability) or is absent; (3) the Daily Briefing / Smart To Do follow-on cards are gated on the tab's open state (suppressed when open, shown+launch when closed). A reintroduced dead-end suggestion or an ungated card MUST fail these cases (negative). Follow the ADR-039 golden-utterance suite + the ADR-038 eval-case obligation.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE developer with eval/test expertise. Comfortable with the ADR-039 golden-utterance eval suite, the ADR-038 integration-heavy testing strategy + eval-case obligation, and the SprkChat / ConversationPane follow-on subsystems being covered.</role>
  <goal>FR-04 (no dead-end follow-on) and FR-06 (card gating) are covered by eval/unit cases that pass now and fail if the behavior regresses — a reintroduced dead-end suggestion or an ungated card fails them.</goal>
  <context>
    <background>FR-10 — the eval-case guardrail: every new/changed AI behavior lands with an eval case (ADR-039 golden-utterance suite + maker-guide obligation, ADR-038). This task adds the E2 coverage for the two behaviors shipped by tasks 021 (suggestion gating) and 023 (follow-on card gating). Case set: (1) an unbacked free-string `SprkChatSuggestions` entry is suppressed / not rendered (guards FR-04 / task 021); (2) "prioritize my tasks" maps to the FR-01 advisory capability and works, or does not render (guards FR-04); (3) the Daily Briefing and Smart To Do follow-on cards render only when the target tab is closed and are suppressed when it is open (guards FR-06 / task 023). Each case MUST be a genuine regression guard — a re-introduced dead-end or an ungated card fails it. Deps: 021 (the suggestion gate) + 023 (the gated cards) must land first so there is behavior to cover.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file>the ADR-039 golden-utterance eval suite (add the FR-04 / FR-06 cases here)</file>
      <file>the SprkChat suggestion gate unit test suite (task 021 output — extend for the unbacked-suppression + "prioritize my tasks" cases)</file>
      <file>the ConversationPane follow-on-card tests (task 023 output — extend for the open/closed card-gating cases)</file>
      <file>projects/spaarkeai-assistant-enhancements-r4/spec.md (FR-04 / FR-06 / FR-10 acceptance)</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>
  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-038" scope="the eval/unit cases">Follow the integration-heavy testing strategy + eval-case obligation; each case is a real regression guard (fails on reintroduced dead-end / ungated card), not a scaffolding/DI-registration/ctor-null test.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-039" scope="the eval cases">Add cases to the golden-utterance suite covering the advisory-capability behaviors (FR-01-backed "prioritize my tasks") without adding a classifier / second decider under test.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project" scope="coverage">Cover BOTH FR-04 (no dead-end follow-on) and FR-06 (card gating) with negative cases that fail on regression (§NFR-08 test obligation).</constraint>
  </constraints>
  <knowledge>
    <files>
      <file>projects/spaarkeai-assistant-enhancements-r4/spec.md</file>
